# Local state / regenerable data
data/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.tmp
# Images: every image the wiki serves is committed, as WebP or (when smaller) SVG: Wookieepedia images
# (free, fair use or untagged, attribution in meta/image_licences.tsv) and the group's own artwork.
# Non-WebP originals live outside the repo in ../art_originals.
images/**/*.png
images/**/*.jpg
images/**/*.jpeg
images/**/*.gif
# hand-downloaded originals waiting for ./wiki.sh images-ingest
images/incoming/
# Copyrighted source-book extracts must never be pushed
private/
Source_Text/

# full-size JPG masters live outside the repo in ../art_originals
images/generated/originals/*.jpg
images/generated/*.jpg
images/full/**/*.png
images/full/**/*.jpg

# VPN configs and downloads hold private keys - never commit
*.ovpn
wg-*.conf
*.conf.bak
Proton Drive Download*.zip
# hand-collected image bundles
*.zip

# Rules sources and working papers stay on your own computer (decision 15 Oct 2026). The SL100: wiki pages are the
# master copy of the rules; keep the original markdown chapters and documents in ../SL100-Sources.
/[0-9][0-9] New Star Wars - *.md
/Talent List*.md
/Special Materials.md
/All about hyperspace.md
/Star Wars *.md
/Starships circa *.md
# Markdown exported from the rules pages for the tools (python3 tools/export_rules.py)
build/
# Collation and review reports (written by the tools, read on your own computer)
docs/
rules/equipment/REVIEW.md
